verify.prompt:
Verify the restart of {{input.workload}} {{input.service}} against the baseline:
{{state.precheck}}

Restart result:
{{state.restart}}

Read-only: k8s_health for the workload (rollout complete? every replica available? restarts reset? new warning events?) and ops_check for its service if it has one. VERIFIED when the rollout completed, all replicas are available and no new problem appears; otherwise FAILED.

Report: the checks and their numbers against the baseline.
